Time-Series Data Search. Source: Bank of Japan. This service uses the API
provided by the "Bank of Japan Time-Series Data Search." The Bank of Japan
does not guarantee the content of the service. Copying or reproducing the
Bank's data for commercial purposes needs the Bank's prior permission.
The answers committed under src/bank_of_japan/responses/ carry the Bank's
layout with synthetic values, not the Bank's data.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Bank of Japan.
